  ENTITY of the system, which is what a real custodian element states: not the
  brand a patient would recognise, and not anything a domain could be turned
  into.

  The pathology this pair reproduces is the one P01 does not reach. P01's FHIR
  half carries a recorder.display naming the organization, so preferring a
  stated name over the endpoint domain is enough to make its two halves agree.
  Here there is no stated name on the FHIR side at all, so the two halves can
  only agree if the display label is derived from the canonical ORIGIN both
  transports resolve to, rather than from whatever each document happens to say.

  Authored for this repository. Invented person, organization, identifiers,
  dates and values. No content is derived from a real record.
-->
